\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces ISD vs. Number of Scenes. Strong positive correlation ($r=0.784$) validates that ISD captures semantic complexity. Videos with more scenes receive higher ISD values, justifying larger frame budgets.}}{9}{figure.caption.14}\protected@file@percent }
